# The README's own pictures, taken by hand. docs/screenshots/README.md is the list.
!docs/screenshots/*.png
# The README's composed boards, framed from those same pictures by the layout
# sources beside them in assets/readme/src/.
!assets/readme/*.png

# Agent state. `.claude/worktrees/` holds real git worktrees: ignoring the
# directory does not detach them, and they were never tracked to begin with.
.claude/
.agents/

# Editor and toolchain droppings.
.vs/
.vscode/
*.pdb
*.ilk
# The design scripts are Python; importing one leaves this beside it.
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Credentials. None of these has ever been in this tree, and the rule is here so
# that stays true by accident as well as on purpose.
.env
.env.*
*.pfx
*.p12
*.pem
*.key

# The Artifact Signing client, when it is fetched into the checkout rather than
# into `%LOCALAPPDATA%`, which is where `scripts/release/sign.ps1` puts it by
# default. It is 14 MB of Microsoft's bytes carrying Microsoft's own version
# number, and the script fetches the version it names; a copy committed here
# would be a second answer to the question of which one signed a release.
/tools/
